    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Christmas Fever! is a classic 2D platformer with extra powerups. Complete 64 different levels and try to achieve the best time possible! Don't let the Beboks spoil the holidays! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holidays are approaching, so get in the Christmas mood by playing Christmas Fever! Explore a wonderful Christmas world with a Snowman and Santa's crew. Help Santa collect coins for gifts. Avoid monsters and traps, collect gifts with specials powers to reach previously inaccessible places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like classic 2D platformer gameplay, challenging levels, replayability, epic adventure and christmas atmosphere, Christmas Fever! is game for You! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Powers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- super speed </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- transformation into a snowball </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- dash jump </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- wall walk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Christmas Fever! is a classic 2D platformer with extra powerups. Complete 64 different levels and try to achieve the best time possible! Don't let the Beboks spoil the holidays! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holidays are approaching, so get in the Christmas mood by playing Christmas Fever! Explore a wonderful Christmas world with a Snowman and Santa's crew. Help Santa collect coins for gifts. Avoid monsters and traps, collect gifts with specials powers to reach previously inaccessible places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like classic 2D platformer gameplay, challenging levels, replayability, epic adventure and christmas atmosphere, Christmas Fever! is game for You! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Powers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- super speed </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- transformation into a snowball </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/b79c7beed7f979b3cce6ad0d34c11ae0.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- dash jump </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/aab31e157d82149e92653a80eb1efe5f.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- wall walk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.poster.avif?t=1734804229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.webm?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178470/extras/62c7469bee9a9ed4dc18f63003b7a83e.mp4?t=1734804229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
